      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ADRENALINE BURST (8) jumped from the inside and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten half a length (22.59) behind Super Symon at this track. The form out of last race has been strong. Can go on with it. ASTON SCANNER (2) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, most recently finishing 2nd at this track over 390m. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Bold showing expected. MEPUNGA BROCKIE (1) hit the ground running off the tricky draw last start and was never headed (22.65) at Geelong in a Grade 5 over 400m. One of the prime contenders. PAW YAZ (7) did a good job to finish third last time out over 435m at Sale (24.90) in a Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
